Subject: [PATCH 23/30] rnbd-srv: replace sess->open_flags with a "bool readonly"
Date: Thu,  8 Jun 2023 13:02:51 +0200
Message-Id: <20230608110258.189493-24-hch@lst.de>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.39.2
